<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E232\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#pleasureYacht> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleCore> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E233\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#pleasureYacht> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E234\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-0510\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E235\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#frameSpanWithinIceStrengtheningZone> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingBasis> \\\"Applicable TRAFICOM regulation wording plus explicit engineering node/operand role\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E236\", \"kind\": \"CALLER_DECLARATION\", \"text\": \"{\\\"declaration\\\": {\\\"admission_id\\\": \\\"SYNTHETIC_RESEARCH_SCOPE_20_I2_066_V1\\\", \\\"approval\\\": {\\\"approved_by\\\": \\\"User\\\", \\\"reference\\\": \\\"Explicit user approval in Codex conversation, 2026-11-25; outputs/audits/20261125_TWENTY_REQUIREMENT_APPROVAL_PREPARATION/scope_approval.provenance.json\\\", \\\"status\\\": \\\"APPROVED\\\"}, \\\"eligibility_assertion\\\": \\\"ASSUMED_EXTERNAL_RESEARCH_ELIGIBILITY\\\", \\\"focus_set\\\": {\\\"mode\\\": \\\"COMPLETE_CLASS_POPULATION_PER_INPUT\\\", \\\"owner_class\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship\\\"}, \\\"format_version\\\": 2, \\\"interpretation\\\": \\\"A\\\", \\\"population_description\\\": \\\"Synthetic design records supplied as the complete declared RDF-class population in each input. External legal/application eligibility and experimental edition selection are caller research assumptions, not inferred RDF facts or real-vessel certification. Records may be incomplete, inconsistent or contain unrecognized values. Conditions within the represented requirement, missing represented inputs, activation, datatype/unit/path and logical correctness remain for generated SHACL to assess. Evaluation covers finite represented inventories, not reconstruction of unrecorded real-world persons/components; this does not authorize inventing existence requirements or treating a represented missing value as compliant. Finite represented weld records and their recorded area/state attributes. Physical inventory completeness and welding inspection are not independently certified. Recorded applicability/state values may be absent or inconsistent and are not assumed true.\\\", \\\"provenance\\\": {\\\"basis\\\": \\\"Retained source, existing declared RDF representation and source-backed finite evaluation preparation; no model performance used.\\\", \\\"declarant\\\": \\\"User\\\", \\\"reference\\\": \\\"Explicit user approval, 2026-11-25, of the sixteen exact declarations in APPROVAL_PROPOSAL.txt; see scope_approval.provenance.json in the preparation audit.\\\"}, \\\"source_editions\\\": [{\\\"document_id\\\": \\\"UR I2\\\", \\\"edition\\\": \\\"Rev.4 (December 2019)\\\", \\\"file\\\": \\\"data/requirements/IACS_I2_full.txt\\\", \\\"selection_provenance\\\": \\\"PROPOSED experimental edition selection from the retained catalog; not a legally governing-edition determination.\\\", \\\"sha256\\\": \\\"7ad8d57459782b70809da479380584a57cf259c66d9ff286811c0248b02732d2\\\"}]}, \\\"declaration_sha256\\\": \\\"422ca52c8c79e96932405a0cf30dbbf24c0fa7f7113b6b2df7521e5c01aa08d8\\\", \\\"policy\\\": {\\\"caller_attestation_is_not_independent_certification\\\": true, \\\"constraint_responsibilities\\\": [\\\"represented requirement obligations\\\", \\\"conditions within the represented requirement\\\", \\\"declared datatypes units and paths\\\", \\\"effective activation within admitted population\\\", \\\"complete query and logical correctness\\\"], \\\"external_responsibilities\\\": [\\\"synthetic research-population eligibility assumption\\\", \\\"applicable source-edition selection and construction-date eligibility\\\"], \\\"interpretation\\\": \\\"A\\\", \\\"no_eligibility_inferred_from_missing_assertions\\\": true}, \\\"scope_definition_sha256\\\": \\\"bfb32a799c0c0d2d391c8d052203a17c0ca5eaee9d0607d5a37611bbfcf4d923\\\", \\\"verification\\\": \\\"Approved common experimental scope, declared class and retained source hashes checked. No input nodes, case identifiers, labels or counterparts loaded; no real-vessel eligibility or legal edition applicability certified.\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"admission\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E237\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#withinIceStrengthenedArea> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E238\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E239\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#doubleContinuousWeld> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E240\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceStrengthenedArea> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Ice strengthened area\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E241\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hullRegionValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Hull region value\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E242\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceStrengthenedArea> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitDecisionStatus> \\\"Not a quantity property\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E243\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#operatingIceType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceAlias> \\\"operating_ice_type\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E244\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hullRegionValue> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-037\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E245\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasWeld> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Has weld\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E246\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hasWeld> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"I2-066\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E247\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceTypeClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_