ue, evidence role, or quantity; its scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E276\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#navigatingInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingBasis> \\\"Applicable TRAFICOM regulation wording plus explicit engineering node/operand role\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E277\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#fishingVessel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E278\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingRule> \\\"N5 - ASCII lowerCamelCase relationship; use has + object role when it improves direction clarity.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E279\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#cargoShip\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Cargo ship\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"cargoShip\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"IMO26-002 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.2 | Chapter 9-1 applicability; IMO26-016 | IMO_AMEND_2026 p.5 | Chapter 11-1 applicability\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E280\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceTypeValue\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Ice type value\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"iceTypeValue\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"ht