nent or subject first, followed by characteristic and qualifier/state; no unsupported external mapping\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E485\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#hullRegionValue\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Hull region value\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"hullRegionValue\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-035 | TRAFICOM p.13 | 4.1.1; TRF-037 | TRAFICOM p.14 | 4.2.2; TRF-043 | TRAFICOM p.18 | 4.4.1; TRF-052 | TRAFICOM p.21 | 4.4.4.2\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E486\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#operatingIceType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Operating ice type\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E487\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#cargoShip> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceAlias> \\\"cargo_ship\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E488\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Ice type\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E489\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#continuousPropulsionPowerAvailableInIce> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Continuous propulsion power available in ice\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E490\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#stage1LocalName> \\\"oilTanker\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E491\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#pleasureYacht> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#roleDecisionBasis> \\\"Explicit engineering entity/artifact class set\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E492\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"xsd:boolean\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#supportsIceStrengthenedFrames\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"DatatypeProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Supports ice strengthened frames\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"supportsIceStrengthenedFrames\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-054 | TRAFICOM p.22-23 | 4.5.2\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E493\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#navigatingInIce> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Navigating in ice\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E494\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#frameSpanWithinIceStrengtheningZone> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \\\"NORMALIZED (Batch 01 development): Frame span within ice strengthening zone is the benchmark representation of the linked requirement operand, relationship, evidence role, or controlled value. Exact scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E495\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> \\\"ice_type\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E496\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#passengerShip> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"IMO-070\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E497\", \"kind\": \"SOURCE\", \"text\": \"         I2.18    Welding\\n\\n         I2.18.1 All welding within ice-strengthened areas is to be of the double continuous type.\\n\\n\", \"origin\": {\"file\": \"data/requirements/IACS_I2_full.txt\", \"authority\": \"User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified\", \"selection\": {\"start\": 61985, \"end\": 62112}}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E498\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designOperationSpeedInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#unitSymbol> \\\"kn\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E499\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Ship\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E500\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#roleDecisionBasis> \\\"Explicit engineering entity/artifact class set\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E501\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designOperationSpeedInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleOperations> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E502\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#withinIceStrengthenedArea> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-049\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E503\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designOperationSpeedInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-040\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E504\", \"kind\": \"SOURCE\", \"text\": \"Jan 2007)   I2.1.1 Application*\\n(Corr.1\\nOct 2007)   This UR applies to Polar Class ships according to UR I1.\\n(Rev.2\\nNov 2010)   I2.1.2 Definitions\\n(Rev.3\\nApr 2016)   I2.1.2.1 The length LUI is the distance, in m, measured horizontally from the fore side of the\\n(Rev.4      stem at the intersection with the upper ice waterline (UIWL) to the after side of the rudder\\nDec 2019)   post, or the centre of the rudder stock if there is no rudder post. LUI is not to be less than\\n            96%, and need not be greater than 97%, of the extreme length of the upper ice waterline\\n            (UIWL) measured horizontally from the fore side of the stem. In ships with unusual stern and\\n            bow arrangement the length LUI will be specially considered.\\n\\n            I2.1.2.2 The ship displacement DUI is the displacement, in kt, of the ship corresponding to the\\n            upper ice waterline (UIWL). Where multiple waterlines are used for determining the UIWL, the\\n            displacement is to be determined from the waterline corresponding to the greatest\\n            displacement.\\n\\n\", \"origin\": {\"file\": \"data/requirements/IACS_I2_full.txt\", \"authority\": \"User-supplied retained source document; interpretations are not independently verified\", \"selection\": {\"start\": 218, \"end\": 1304}}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E505\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceStrengthenedArea> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleHull> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E506\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceType\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"ObjectProperty\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Ice load source type\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"iceLoadSourceType\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceTypeValue\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-057 | TRAFICOM p.23 | 4.6.1\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\\\": \\\"\\\"}\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"schema_terms\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E507\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"IMO-109\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E508\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceTypeValue> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-DEV-B01-126\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E509\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceTypeClassification> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Ice type classification\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E510\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#doubleContinuousWeld> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Double continuous weld\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E511\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#internalIceStrengthenedStructure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E512\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceTypeClassification> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"IMO-004\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E513\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#passengerShip> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Passenger ship\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E514\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#locatedWithinIceBelt> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-053\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E515\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#markingPlainlyVisibleInIceConditions> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-133\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E516\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceTypeValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E517\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#supportsIceStrengthenedFrames> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E518\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#continuousPropulsionPowerAvailableInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-DEV-B01-029\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E519\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designOperationSpeedInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceReference> \\\"TRF-040 | TRAFICOM p.16 | 4.3.1; TRF-065 | TRAFICOM p.26 | 5\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E520\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#weld> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#draftConceptId> \\\"VOC-R7-0003\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E521\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#module> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#moduleCore> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E522\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#shipIceStrengthened> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#evidenceExcerpt> \\\"The Manual shall include risk-based procedures to be followed for: contacting emergency response providers for salvage, search and rescue (SAR), spill response, etc., as applicable; and, in the case of ships ice strengthened in accordance with chapter 3, procedures for maintaining life support and ship integrity in the event of prolonged entrapment by ice.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E523\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#shipOperatesInIceCoveredWaters> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Ship operates in ice covered waters\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E524\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#weldType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-050\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E525\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#navigatingInIce> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceRequirementId> \\\"TRF-016\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E526\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E527\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sidescuttleInIceBelt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> \\\"Sidescuttle in ice belt\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E528\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#passengerShip> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#sourceReference> \\\"IMO-070 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.24 | 8.3.3.1.1; IMO-118 | IMO_POLAR_CODE p.43 | 4.2.2\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E529\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#designOperationSpeedInIce> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> \\\"Design operation speed in ice\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E530\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#locatedWithinIceBelt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E531\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#shipOperatesInIceCoveredWaters> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#evidenceExcerpt> \\\"Ships shall have means to ensure safe evacuation of persons, including safe deployment of survival equipment, when operating in ice-covered waters, or directly onto the ice, as applicable.\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E532\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#ship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E533\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#operatingIceType> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#stage1LocalName> \\\"operatingIceType\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E534\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceTypeValue> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> \\\"NORMALIZED (Batch 01 development): Ice load source type value is the benchmark representation of the linked requirement operand, relationship, evidence role, or controlled value. Exact scope is limited to the cited requirements.\\\"@en .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E535\", \"kind\": \"RDF_FACT\", \"text\": \"<https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#oilTanker> <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#namingBasis> \\\"Benchmark-coined descriptive engineering term\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .\", \"origin\": {\"context_field\": \"ontology_evidence\"}}, {\"evidence_id\": \"E536\", \"kind\": \"SCHEMA_TEXT\", \"text\": \"{\\\"datatype\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"iri\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#iceLoadSourceTypeValue\\\", \\\"kind\\\": \\\"Class\\\", \\\"label\\\": \\\"Ice load source type value\\\", \\\"localName\\\": \\\"iceLoadSourceTypeValue\\\", \\\"parentOrRange\\\": \\\"https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#benchmarkEntity\\\", \\\"sourceRefs\\\": \\\"TRF-057 | TRAFICOM p.23 | 4.6.1\\\", \\\"unitIri\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"unitSymbol\